            <div xml:id="d58">

                <pb facs="0102" n="92" sameAs="frus:frus1945v07/pg92"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.0011 P.W./4–1245: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Chargé in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Briggs</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-04-16T18:00:00-04:00">April 16, 1945—6
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>585. Swedish and Swiss Ministers have approached the Department (your 610, April
                    12, 9 a.m. and previous) which is studying their proposal as well as the general
                    question involved.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Stettinius</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
